  "summary": "古赋多贬武曲破军同宫及命身分守，作者解释破军耗星、先破后立与开创性质：会吉可建设，少吉多煞忌则易破坏；左辅右弼或禄存可增稳，亲情刑克也须看会吉会煞，不能当成无条件结论。将星为性质称谓，二限原文疑字不补。",
  "summary_en": "Classical verses criticize Wu Qu and Po Jun together or divided between Life and Body Palaces. The author explains Po Jun as a consuming and pioneering star: many benefics support rebuilding, whereas little auspicious support with malefics or adverse transformations may produce destruction without construction. Zuo Fu, You Bi or co-located Lu Cun can stabilize its impulsiveness. Harm to family relationships is also conditional on benefic and malefic support. Jiang Xing is an epithet, not a separate star; unclear two-cycle wording is not repaired.",
